[en.DECISION_C04_WASHOUTS_TOUR_1]
Prohibit the Washouts Tour

[en.DECISION_C04_WASHOUTS_TOUR_1_desc]
The Washouts are preparing for their next tour! If we let them carry on with their performances, they will spread dangerous ideas during the tour, attracting more and more fans. But if we attempt to stop them, they can use it as an excuse to promote dissatisfication among the public.

[zh.DECISION_C04_WASHOUTS_TOUR_1]
阻止淘汰者巡回演出

[zh.DECISION_C04_WASHOUTS_TOUR_1_desc]
淘汰者正在准备下一次巡回演出！如果让他们进行演出，他们则会在其上宣扬危险的想法，吸引越来越多的粉丝；但如果阻止他们的演出，他们更可能借此为由煽动民众的不满情绪。
